	abstract     = {SPARQL query editors often lack intuitive interfaces&nbsp;to aid SPARQL-savvy users to write queries. To address this issue,&nbsp;we propose an easy-to-deploy, triple store-agnostic and open-source query editor that offers three main features: (i) automatic&nbsp;query example rendering, (ii) precise autocomplete based on existing triple patterns including within SERVICE clauses, and&nbsp;(iii) a data-aware schema visualization. It can be easily set up with&nbsp;a custom HTML element. The tool has been successfully tested&nbsp;on various public endpoints, and is deployed online&nbsp;at  with open-source code available at .},
